WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.367
-Do you ever see a photo
in the news

00:00:02.367 --> 00:00:03.634
and think the headline
should be different?

00:00:03.634 --> 00:00:05.067
I'll show you. We'll take care
of that right now.

00:00:05.067 --> 00:00:06.100
It's time for
"News &amp; Improved."

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:07.367
Here we go.

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:13.167
-♪ News and improved ♪

00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:15.033
-The headline could be better.
-Sure.

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:16.834
-Let me give you an example.
This first photo here.

00:00:16.834 --> 00:00:20.100
The original headline was...

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.868
That headline can
definitely be improved.

00:00:21.868 --> 00:00:23.601
Because if you only
looked at the photo,

00:00:23.601 --> 00:00:26.634
the headline could have been...

00:00:26.634 --> 00:00:28.501
-Aww.

00:00:28.501 --> 00:00:32.234
[ Applause ]

00:00:32.234 --> 00:00:36.434
-Up next, this headline says...

00:00:36.434 --> 00:00:40.033
Headline could have been...

00:00:40.033 --> 00:00:42.434
It's like, "Oh. Sorry!

00:00:42.434 --> 00:00:45.234
I didn't see anything."

00:00:45.234 --> 00:00:49.767
Next headline was...

00:00:49.767 --> 00:00:53.534
Headline could have been...

00:00:53.534 --> 00:00:56.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:59.801
"I'm gonna go see 'Avatar.'"

00:00:59.801 --> 00:01:03.367
Next headline was...

00:01:03.367 --> 00:01:05.434
Headline could have been...

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:11.601
"No specials because
everything here is a special?"

00:01:11.601 --> 00:01:15.033
[ Laughs hysterically ]

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:17.167
Next headline was...

00:01:20.167 --> 00:01:23.701
Headline could have been...

00:01:23.701 --> 00:01:26.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:26.634 --> 00:01:29.133
♪♪

00:01:29.133 --> 00:01:32.634
Next headline was...

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:35.801
Headline could have been...

00:01:35.801 --> 00:01:39.067
-Oh. Wow.

00:01:39.067 --> 00:01:41.801
[ Applause ]

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:45.634
-Next headline was...

00:01:45.634 --> 00:01:47.434
Headline could have been...

00:01:50.234 --> 00:01:54.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:54.534 --> 00:01:58.067
The next headline was...

00:01:58.067 --> 00:02:02.067
Headline could have been...

00:02:02.067 --> 00:02:05.000
"Oh! Curry, over here!
Steph, Steph! Right here, man!"

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:07.167
